{"id":"word:hebrew:H7522","type":"word","title":"רָצוֹן","subtitle":"H7522 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"delight (especially as shown)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רָצוֹן (H7522) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 56 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רָצוֹן (râtsôwn) means delight (especially as shown) First listed occurrence: 2Chr 15 15."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רָצוֹן","transliteration":"râtsôwn","pronunciation":"raw-tsone'","strong":"H7522","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7522","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["רְצוֹנֽ/וֹ","רָצוֹן֙","כִּ/רְצוֹנָֽ/ם","לְ/רָצ֖וֹן","רָצ֖וֹן"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",15],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",6],["HR/Ncmsa",6],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",6],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp2mp",4],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",3],["HNcmsc",3],["HR/Ncmsc",2],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",2],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp2ms",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"delight (especially as shown)","usage":"(be) acceptable(-ance, -ed), delight, desire, favour, (good) pleasure, (own, self, voluntary) will, as...(what) would.","full":"H7522. ratson רָצוֺן noun [masculine] goodwill, favour, acceptance, will ; — absolute ׳ר Deut 33:23 +; construct רְצוֺן Psa 145:19 +; suffix רְצוֺנִי Isa 60:10 , רְצֹנוֺ Dan 8:4 +, etc.; — 1 goodwill, favour: a. of God , Deut 33:16 ; Isa 60:10 ; Psalm 5:13; Psa 30:6 ; 30:8 ; Psalm 51:20; 89:18 ; 106:4 ; Prov 8:35 ; 12:2 ; 18:22 ; ר ׳עֵת Isa 49:8 ; Psa 69:14 ; ר ׳יוֺם Isa 58:5 ; ׳שְׁנַתרֿ 61:2 ; || בְּרָכָה Deut 33:23 ; opposed to תּוֺעֵבָה Prov 11:1 , 20 ; 12:22 ; 15:8 . b. of men: in General Prov 10:32 ; 11:27 ; 14:9 ; of kings 14:35 ; 16:13 , 15 ; 19:12 . 2 acceptance , of persons, offering sacrifice, יהוה לפני לרצון Exod 28:38 (P); with ל person for acceptance for him before ׳י ; with suffix person לרצנוֺ Lev 1:3 ; abbreviated לָכֶם לְרָצוֺן 22:20 , לרצנכם 19:5 ; 22:19 , 29 ; 23:11 , לצֵּון 22:21 ; Isa 56:7 ; Jer 6:20 ; Psalm 19:15 (of words; compare Hosea 14:3 ); רצון על Isa 60:7 (read לְ , so Manuscripts, see Gi, also Du), רצון Mal 2:13 . 3 will, desire, pleasure: a. of God , ר ׳עשׂה do his will Ezra 10:11 ; Psa 40:9 ; 103:21 ; 143:10 . b. of man , כרצונוֺ עשׂה do according to his will , exactly as he pleased, Dan 8:4 ; 11:3 , 16 , 36 ; Neh 9:24 ; Est 1:8 ; 9:5 , compare Neh 9:37 ; desire Psa 145:16 ; 145:19 ; 2Chr 15:15 ; = self-will Gen 49:6 (poem).","rootNote":"or רָצֹן ; from 7521 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 15 15","keyReferences":["2Chr 15 15","Dan 8 4","Dan 11 3","Dan 11 16","Dan 11 36","Deut 33 16","Deut 33 23","Esth 1 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":56,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 15 15","book":"2Chr","chapter":15,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רְצוֹנָ֣/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Dan 8 4","book":"Dan","chapter":8,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִ/רְצֹנ֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 11 3","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִּ/רְצוֹנֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 11 16","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִּ/רְצוֹנ֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Dan 11 36","book":"Dan","chapter":11,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִ/רְצוֹנ֜/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Deut 33 16","book":"Deut","chapter":33,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/רְצ֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Deut 33 23","book":"Deut","chapter":33,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"רָצ֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Esth 1 8","book":"Esth","chapter":1,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כִּ/רְצ֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Esth 9 5","book":"Esth","chapter":9,"ver